{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1221103001:1":{"text":"바다에, 반짝반짝한 물건, 있다!","source_cn":"海面有，亮晶晶的，东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B93182F7DC328B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221103002:1":{"text":"어라? 바다에 정말 반짝거리는 물건이 있어요. 저거 너희가 떨어뜨린 거야?","source_cn":"咦？海面上真的有个闪闪发光的东西。是你们掉的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507C69424D05A921","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221103003:1":{"text":"아니, 저 머~언 곳에서 떠내려왔다!","source_cn":"不是。它从——很远很远，漂过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C9556DB92C37989","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221103004:1":{"text":"떠내려왔다고? 설마 표류병 같은 건가?","source_cn":"漂过来的？难道是漂流瓶之类的东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94DCFEBEB66654B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221103005:1":{"text":"물병이, 아주 많아! 안에, 좋은 게 있어!","source_cn":"瓶子，很多！里面，会有好东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D562E1DF41FA591","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221103006:1":{"text":"빛나는 꽃, 좋아! 하지만 가질 수 없어…","source_cn":"荧荧花，喜欢！可是，拿不到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x042B4944CEE0F76D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221103007:1":{"text":"표류병이 이곳까지 떠내려오다니, 보기 드문 일이네요. 병에는 뭐가 들어있을까요?","source_cn":"居然会有漂流瓶漂到这里，真是难得一见。不知道瓶子里会装...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31CAFA6D14724794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221103008:1":{"text":"마스터, 한 번 건져볼까요?","source_cn":"主人，我们要不要把它捞上来看看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF7FA03CD637FA24D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 한 번 건져볼까요?","female":"마스터, 한 번 건져볼까요?","variant_male_record_index":"134616","variant_female_record_index":"134617","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221103009:1":{"text":"하지만 건질만한 마땅한 도구가 없는데...","source_cn":"可我们手头也没有打捞工具呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCE3265B608634F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221103010:1":{"text":"근처에, <style=\"highlight\">그물</style>, 조각, 있어! 건져서, 붙이면, 가능해!","source_cn":"附近，有<style=highlight>渔网</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC65B9E6CDA283D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status"